                </div>
                <div class="bento-container grid-3">
                    
                <div class="bento-card">
                    <div class="card-top"><span class="card-pill">확인 1</span></div>
                    <h3 class="card-title">서비스명</h3>
                    <ul class="card-bullets"><li>가칭 '패션 이너 테라피' 확정 여부</li></ul>
                </div>
                
                <div class="bento-card">
                    <div class="card-top"><span class="card-pill">확인 2</span></div>
