        <section class="slide " id="slide-9" data-slide="9">
            
            <div class="slide-content title-layout">
                <div class="category-tag">NEXT STEP</div>
                <h1 class="hero-title">기획 확정 → 디자인 → 퍼블리싱 → 배포</h1>
                <p class="hero-subtitle">남미화 박사 자문으로 유형·문항을 확정하는 즉시, 산출물/ 폴더 기준 정적 사이트 개발에 착수할 수 있습니다.</p>
                <div class="meta-footer">
                    <span>패션테라피진흥원 · 개발 기획팀</span>
                    <span class="dot">•</span>
                    <span>Thank You</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
        </section>
        
        <div class="deck-controls">
            <span class="counter" id="slide-counter">1 / 9</span>
            <button class="btn" id="prev-btn" title="Previous (←)">◀</button>
            <button class="btn" id="next-btn" title="Next (→)">▶</button>
            <button class="btn" id="fs-btn" title="Fullscreen (F)">⛶</button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        let currentSlide = 1;
        const totalSlides = 9;

        function updateSlide(newIndex) {
            if (newIndex < 1 || newIndex > totalSlides) return;
            document.querySelectorAll('.slide').forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
            const target = document.getElementById(`slide-${newIndex}`);
            if (target) {
                target.classList.add('active');
                currentSlide = newIndex;
                document.getElementById('slide-counter').innerText = `${currentSlide} / ${totalSlides}`;
            }
        }

        document.getElementById('prev-btn').addEventListener('click', () => updateSlide(currentSlide - 1));
        document.getElementById('next-btn').addEventListener('click', () => updateSlide(currentSlide + 1));
        document.getElementById('fs-btn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (!document.fullscreenElement) {
                document.documentElement.requestFullscreen().catch(err => console.log(err));
            } else {
                document.exitFullscreen();
            }
        });

        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            if (e.key === 'ArrowRight' || e.key === ' ' || e.key === 'Enter') {
                updateSlide(currentSlide + 1);
            } else if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') {
                updateSlide(currentSlide - 1);
            } else if (e.key === 'f' || e.key === 'F') {
                if (!document.fullscreenElement) {
                    document.documentElement.requestFullscreen().catch(err => console.log(err));
                } else {
                    document.exitFullscreen();
                }
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
